                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Shawn McCarney",
                        "email": "shawnmm@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "smccarney"
                    },
                    "message": "This sentence is a little confusing.  It sounds like maybe all inventory items have a unique inventory ID.\n\nI'd suggest something like \"Retrieve the chassis ID for the given D-Bus inventory path.\""
                },
                {
